# Python bytecode (e.g. from running/testing 5-webapp/ locally)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Leaflet is vendored at install time (5-webapp/install-webapp.sh), not
# committed - mirrors how 4-waydroid-tools/03-setup-tools.sh downloads
# the GPS mock-location APK rather than checking it in. Device spoofing
# no longer downloads anything - see 4-waydroid-tools/device-profiles/.
/5-webapp/static/vendor/
/4-waydroid-tools/mock-location.apk
